sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant EventDish as EventDish
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+EventDish: remove(reason)
    Note over EventDish: Policies: eventDishRead, eventDishWrite, eventDishExecute
    Note over EventDish: Guards (3)
    EventDish->>EventDish: guard[0]: self.selectedAt != null
    EventDish->>EventDish: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    EventDish->>EventDish: guard[2]: self.event != null and self.event.stage == #quot;planning#quot; or ...
    EventDish->>EventDish: compute.previousQuantityServings
    EventDish->>EventDish: mutate.deletedAt
    EventDish->>EventDish: mutate.removedAt
    EventDish->>EventBus: emit EventDishRemoved on event_dish.removed
    EventDish-->>-Client: void